# Cloudflare Pages _redirects — rules evaluated in order, first match wins.

# Block /panel/* on this public site. The admin panel is a SEPARATE
# Cloudflare Pages project (ocs-super-panel.pages.dev) that builds from
# the panel/ subdirectory of this repo. We don't want the source code
# accidentally served from the public domain even with Cloudflare Access
# in front of the panel project — defense in depth.
/panel/*  /  404
/panel    /  404

